    <bf:summary>
      <bf:Summary>
	<rdfs:label>Gamer Girls are four besties who prove that girls can game! But when a new game comes out, it's not a hit with everyone. Maybe they should stick to video game battles instead of middle school arguments!</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Summary>
    </bf:summary>
